{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","强制入局"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","邀请所有敌方英雄参与博弈，博弈失败者向埃德加支付属性并受到伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“邀请”所有非召唤物敌人参与埃德加的博弈，每名敌人各投掷1枚骰子并独立结算胜负。敌人每受到来自不同友军的属性降低效果时，永久叠加1层“厄运”，至多叠加3层。每层“厄运”使敌人投掷出的点数降低1点。当敌方点数小于等于3点时视为博弈失败，令其向埃德加支付其20% + 2%攻击力和15% + 1.5%生命上限，并对其造成3次160% ATK伤害。每名敌人至多向埃德加支付3次属性，埃德加通过该效果获得的攻击力和生命上限不超过自身对应属性的100% + 10%。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":129,"end":134,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":141,"end":148,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":221,"end":227,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg7"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":160,"end":168,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","博弈失败的敌人每次受到的伤害提升至170% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","博弈失败的敌人每次受到的伤害提升至180% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","博弈失败的敌人每次受到的伤害提升至190% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","博弈失败的敌人每次受到的伤害提升至200% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","折扇杀机"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","使用折扇扇叶依次攻击所有非召唤物敌人，并根据敌人的“厄运”层数提升伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","按当前生命比例从低到高的顺序，朝非召唤物敌人依次发射总计9枚折扇扇叶，每枚扇叶造成70% + 10% ATK伤害。目标每有1层“厄运”，本技能造成伤害额外提高10% + 1%。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":44,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":82,"end":87,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":41,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次伤害提升至75% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次伤害提升至80% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次伤害提升至85% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","藏锋回旋"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","扔出折扇持续攻击敌人最密集区域并获得护盾。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","朝最密集的敌方区域扔出旋转的折扇并获得可抵御300% ATK伤害的护盾，随后在1.5秒内，对其周围1格内敌人造成4次170% + 20% ATK伤害。随后收回折扇，额外获得此次技能实际造成伤害20% + 2%的护盾。本技能提供的护盾持续8秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":62,"end":68,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":99,"end":104,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":58,"end":72,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至180% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至190% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至200% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速，若有敌人在博弈中失败额外提升急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，埃德加提高10点急速，若有敌人在博弈中失败，额外提高6点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，埃德加提高14点急速，若有敌人在博弈中失败，额外提高7点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，埃德加提高18点急速，若有敌人在博弈中失败，额外提高8点急速。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","满盘皆输"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","博弈失败的敌人将会受到若干次额外伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","释放终极技能时，若敌人博弈失败，埃德加在结算时额外对其造成1次200% ATK伤害。此后每次失败使该技能伤害次数增加1次，至多造成3次伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","额外伤害提升至225% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","非首领敌人在博弈中累计失败2次时，使其在本局战斗的剩余时间内永久失去所有属性增益效果，攻击力额外降低埃德加攻击力的15%，至多使目标攻击力降低至其初始值的20%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","额外伤害提升至250% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时收取敌方英雄的基础属性作为入场费用。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，埃德加收取所有非召唤物敌人7%基础属性作为入场费用，收取总值不超过自身对应属性的35%。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"keyword:basicattr"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","掩心折扇"]]}